<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore to award S$11.2 bln in public contracts.</title>
<headline>Singapore to award S$11.2 bln in public contracts.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore will award Singapore $11.2 billion worth of public sector construction contracts in 1997, against S$10.5 billion in 1996, the Ministry of Trade and Industry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 1996 figure was an increase of 19 percent over the value of contracts reported in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
